 of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2y-5x+3z=-1 \\\\ x-3y=3 \\\\ -3y+2z-x=-5\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & a & 3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & b \\\\ c & -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186345099 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y+z=-1 \\\\ z+3x-2y=3 \\\\ -y+2z-x=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & b & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & c\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186345100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2z+x-5y=1 \\\\ -y+5z-4x=-2 \\\\ 2x-6y-z=2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -5 & a \\\\ b & -1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & c & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186345101 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}z-5x+2y=0 \\\\ z=1-2x \\\\ 7y-3x-2z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & a & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 7 & c\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ b \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186354631 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y=1 \\\\ x-8y=-2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186360768 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}y+2z-x=1 \\\\ 6y+3x-2z=2 \\\\ x+3z-y=-3\\end{a